WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:07.190
Shushin and Ochu confronted the heretic sect running wild by the border - the Blood Clouds Sect.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:14.270
Even though Ruri defeated the Twelve Wicked of the Blood Clouds and eradicated the Blood Clouds Sec,

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.870
another sect was simultaneously trying to become closer with the Ming Empire.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.200
That sect's name was...

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:24.990
Chikyou.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.400
I understand what you are saying.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.490
I'd like to request a investigation into the Chikyou sect.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.370
I wonder if the current Koumyoufu is up to that task.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:21.350
I am well aware that replies to inquiries,

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:25.110
including the one about the truth surrounding the Blood Clouds sect, are taking some time.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.020
What is the reason for this? What are you going to do about it?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.770
What is the current situation?

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:31.930
Your highness, please understand...

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:36.360
Nothing... I'll answer your questions at a later date.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:40.280
Are you telling me <i>the Prince</i> to come back later?

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.640
Do you have a problem with that?

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:53.350
If it isn't Gaku Keiyo!

00:02:55.530 --> 00:03:00.380
I was asked to look into it, but my founder's instructions weren't very clear.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:04.470
Oh yeah, you're from an important family of enlightened.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.730
And you asked the Koumyoufu to perform that investigation?

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.940
Yes, but...

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.140
What?

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.960
It's already been ten days since I've sent the request letter, yet I still haven't received a reply.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.050
Ten days?!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.550
Yes, apparently it's still being processed...

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.570
What are those guys doing!?

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.220
Alright, I'll go there with you.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.060
It's been ten days, ten days!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:31.630
I-I understand that you're doing this for me, but please be more gentle.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:36.310
It's ok, the Koumyoufu is totally in the wrong when it comes to this matter.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:39.010
Your Highness, ten days is...

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:41.570
Your work efficiency is horrendous.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.210
Consider this to be your top priority and get it done.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:46.160
But, we have to respect the order...

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.280
Is that more important than the crown prince's order?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.110
It should all be good now.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:58.090
Now, we just have to wait inside.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.900
Thank you so much.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.330
But I'm not sure that using your earthly status to get what you want is okay...

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:04.950
Ahh, you're right.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:09.260
I'm a disciple of the Reikenzan sect first, and the prince of the Ming Empire second.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.600
I'm sorry for being so arrogant.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.560
No, it's ok. I was the one that was shallow.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.320
Are you Gaku Keiyo-<i>sama</i>?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.390
Yes, that's me.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:23.790
Thank god, a customer wants to talk to you.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.090
To me?

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:29.930
First it was Ruri and now Gaku Keiyo.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:33.610
I just keep bumping into other Reikenzan disciples here.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:39.290
A lot has happened and I think I'll soon be able to become a level 6 <i>renki</i>.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:42.630
You even feel different from when we were back in Reiken mountain.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.000
That's because I'm now the awoken Bunho.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.970
Awoken Bunho?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.310
I don't really understand, but it sounds cool.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.830
Oh, Shushin, good morning!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:58.200
Huh, you've developed quite an attitude since I last saw you.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.130
Attitude, what attitude?

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.970
I'm Shushin and you're Bunho.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.160
Do you understand?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.920
Well, I don't dislike you.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.630
You!?

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.160
You should only have a big face and belly, not an attitude.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.870
Come on guys!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:19.920
I'm sure we have a lot to talk about, so let's go inside, okay?

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:26.860
So, earlier you told me you had gone to an archeological site?

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.030
It was called...

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.770
Ranjukobo.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.980
That's quite a place!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.760
Did you not come across any dangerous stuff?

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.990
There were a few times when I got a bit frightened but...

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:38.950
Your highness.

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.430
Here's the unprocessed report.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:43.280
What, this is it?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.950
The Koumyoufu was only able to process this amount of information?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.580
You made Gaku Keiyo wait ten days for this?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.690
What was the administrative staff doing!?

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.750
Please take a closer look, your highness.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.150
That is only a list of the documents.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:03.250
As it's written there, we have around two thousand documents in our warehouse.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.670
Two thousand!?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.220
If you can read them all then I can arrange to have them brought here.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.140
Why did you accumulate so many!?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.820
Please, allow me to explain.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:23.090
As you are aware, by order of the imperial court the Koumyoufu is not allowed to have branches.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:28.770
In other words, documents from all over the Empire related to enlightened can only be processed here.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:32.030
From insignificantly small sects to the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance sects.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.790
From things that require a lot of attention to those that don't.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:39.900
Do you think it is unreasonable for there to be delays?

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.320
No...

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.950
If this continues, the Koumyoufu will eventually have to stop its activities.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:50.480
If that happens, there's a chance it might be able to change enough in the future to be useful to the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:58.800
Your highness, unfortunately the current Koumyoufu is not able to efficiently handle the Empire's cases anymore.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.850
That's the truth.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.650
I understand.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:07.730
Thank you for your understanding.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:15.160
Well then, the fact that it took so long to process this case allowed an interesting outcome to happen.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.620
What do you mean?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.270
Gaku Keiyo-<i>sama</i>.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.510
Yes?

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:24.520
This letter that you brought in awhile back is related to the Chikyou sect, am I correct?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.650
Yes, that's it.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.320
If I'm not mistaken, your highness also asked about it.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.580
I have intentions of asking the Koumyoufu to look into it, yes.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.400
This one here was delivered to us three days ago.

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.030
The sender was the founder of the Chikyou sect.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.290
What!?

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.450
The founder?!

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:47.410
It addresses the social status of their diplomatic envoy to the Koumyoufu.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.980
It's basically a letter of introduction.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:55.630
And the one appointed as that representative is none other than the head of the diplomacy department, Bunho.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.820
No way!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.690
It can't be!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:01.370
That's you, am I right?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.010
Indeed, I'm Bunho, the head of the Chikyou's diplomacy department.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:15.160
How dare you say that so shamelessly!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.890
Why did you join the Chikyou?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.190
I'm sure you've notice how dodgy it is!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:21.610
Do you resent me?

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:25.070
I'm just worried that you might be being deceived.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.150
That's very thoughtful of you.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.970
Why did I join up with the Chikyou?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.650
You know, Gaku Keiyo...

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:34.760
Yes?

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.600
It was because I love you.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:54.510
How could you say that all of a sudden!?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.580
I wanted to become the perfect man for you.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.370
And how would that happen?

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.390
Don't try and bullshit your way out of this.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.080
Bullshit?

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:06.440
If that's all you can say then be quiet!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.240
What's up with him?

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.720
He's completely different from before.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:14.120
Gaku Keiyo, part of an important family of enlightened.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.220
I might be the son of a well-known teacher, but I'm still just from a family of commoners.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.000
I know that I'm no match for you.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.330
And that's not all.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.450
My looks as well...

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.170
You're right.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.230
But I didn't want to give up.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.380
I want to become a man worthy of you.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:37.050
And to do that I can only work hard, in my own way, and produce results.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.350
That still doesn't explain why.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:40.220
And by that you mean...

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.730
How does that relate to Chikyou?

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:47.960
You could always just work hard in our clan, if that was the case.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:53.070
If training with our sect was enough then why did they send us to the mundane world for our trial?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:54.860
That's...

00:09:54.860 --> 00:10:00.270
Even if we're in the mundane world, for people like you who have been born in privileged conditions...

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:02.910
there is very little difference to being in the sect.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:07.430
So you are saying that, in order to gain even more experience,

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:10.840
they intentionally turned a bling eye to the newly emerging Chikyou?

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:13.960
You really are fast at getting the point.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.070
Thank you.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.100
However, that's not all.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:22.790
At the end of the day, my actions are all for the sake of people that I love.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.870
And for me, at this current moment,

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.880
it isn't just for Gaku Keiyo's sake.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.070
It's also for yours!

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.360
Mine?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.530
I love you.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.850
A-are you okay?

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.250
Why wouldn't I be?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.060
First you say you love Gaku Keiyo.

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:55.490
And now all of a sudden you say you love me?

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:56.530
Yes.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:11:01.770
Both personally and professionally, I really don't enjoy that kind of self-centered attitude.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.050
Is it wrong?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.920
It makes me sick!

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:09.110
Furthermore, what do you know about me, we only just met!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.310
I know everything.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.060
Real name, Ri Nana.

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:17.010
Even though you joined the Koumyoufu at a young age,

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.780
to you the Koumyoufu is not just your workplace.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:23.800
After having moved to this region,

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:28.080
your father's talent was noticed by the Koumyoufu and he was put in charge of running it.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:34.590
Having been forced into the job as your father's successor while still being quite young, it didn't go very well for you.

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:37.210
The support of the imperial court rapidly fell

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:42.550
and the Koumyoufu's influence and administrative powers are now mere shadows of themselves.

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.160
I see...

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:48.650
You did a lot of research about me.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.180
Are you here to laugh at my incompetence?

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.750
Please...

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.230
You have good potential.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:12:00.380
Not only were you taught by your father you are also far smarter than the average enlightened.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:06.310
As you said before, the Koumyoufu is already running inefficiently.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:09.080
And dragging your talent down with it.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.830
That's why I want to save you.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.170
Save me?

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.450
<i>You</i> will save <i>me</i>?

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:19.060
I'm sure the Koumyoufu is in desperate need of a branch

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:23.280
and people working for it that can reach out to the whole Empire.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.350
And the Chikyou can easily offer that.

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.130
H-Hey!

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.480
What are your conditions?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.820
Are you crazy?!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.010
We want the Koumyoufu's approval.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:38.550
No way!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:41.410
There's no way the Great Ming Empire will join forces with a heretic sect!

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:43.130
Shut your mouth, Shushin!

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.360
What did you say?!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:48.110
I know it's a heretic sect, but what have you actually seen of the Chikyou?

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:51.790
I'm sure you haven't even met a Chikyou follower yet, have you?

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.470
If you see it with your own eyes and feel it with your own hands

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:59.740
and only then come to a conclusion, then that is fine.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.460
If that is even possible.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:09.080
Bunho-<i>sama</i>, the relationship between organizations can very quickly fall apart at the seams.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.390
Do you believe that this will not happen to us?

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:13.370
Of course.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.920
And what do you base this on?

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:20.840
Because the basis of this conversation is not just an unpolished abacus.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.150
Then is there anything else?

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:25.700
Yes, my love for you.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.030
Gaku Keiyo, what is your opinion on this?

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:34.800
I think at this current point it's a mistake to treat them as any other heretic sect.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.670
Why are you saying that kind of stuff too?!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.760
It's so wobbly.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.530
Hey, Ruri, how long are you going to keep doing that?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.640
It's so so cool!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.390
Welcome back!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.560
That took awhile.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.410
That wasn't Bunho, it was Oriku!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.150
Normally, it would be impossible.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:08.160
But it's possible if you use the Authority Jewel's control capabilities.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.960
It think he's able to control someone else's body using it.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.450
Because I love you.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.530
That jerk!

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:30.060
But if that's true, then it means that Oriku is connected to the Chikyou sect.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.340
I don't think Oriku would work under Bunho...

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:37.500
If Bunho is the head of the diplomacy department, then above him can only be...

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.970
We can't wait for the Koumyoufu anymore.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:43.520
I have to order the relevant authorities to look for information on the Chikyou.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.220
They use of the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique and have a few million aspiring followers?!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.410
This is not only suspicious, it's absolutely incriminating.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.530
This is definitely heretic.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.600
Shushin-<i>sama</i>

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:11.220
What is it?

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:17.270
Just now a person claming to be a follower of the Chikyou sect asked me to hand this to you.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:19.810
Chikyou's?!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:30.170
We're nearly at the rendezvous point.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:12.080
Were you surprised that I was here?

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.150
O-on the contrary.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:18.330
As if I'd come to such a place if I didn't already know it was you.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:23.020
Damn, I was hoping to take you by surprise, seeing as we haven't seen each other for awhile.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.050
A-anyway.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:30.840
Gaku Keiyo, it's not like you to hang out with heretics like these guys.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:33.580
Heretic? What do you mean?

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.940
You don't have to play dumb anymore!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.070
It's going to tip over...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.170
I have no intentions of going for a swim with you.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:48.300
You won't be able to stay so calm for much longer.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:49.870
And by that you mean...

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:54.460
I'm taking the liberty of reporting the Chikyou sect to our elders and request a thorough investigation.

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.240
I see.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.940
But that has nothing to do with me.

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:00.840
Oriku, don't underestimate me.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:03.890
I know you're connected to the Chikyou.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:07.160
Hey hey, don't get me involved in your delusions.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:11.680
If that Bunho is such a high-ranking official, then you have to be above him.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.350
You're probably even the founder yourself.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.660
What are you going on about...

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.580
If this is indeed the case,

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.880
then there's no way you haven't had a hand in the use of

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.830
the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique or the large number of Chikyou's followers.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:27.250
Oriku, you're done for.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.940
Is that all you have to say?

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:30.630
What!?

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.640
Shushin, you...

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:37.170
Okay, Gaku Keiyo.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:40.250
Let's report him together.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.260
If we do that we'll...

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:46.570
There's a saying that goes: "You can trust what you have seen with your own two eyes".

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.150
I don't think you should judge them...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.300
Until you've actually seen their sect.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:57.880
Gaku Keiyo!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.810
Are you siding with a heretic sect now!?

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.920
Not necessarily.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.310
Then what!?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.780
It's just that...

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.020
Answer me, Gaku Keiyo!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.610
It's just...

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.550
Hey, we're getting off now.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.090
Why?...

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.600
Because...

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.230
He said he loved me.

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.930
Because I love you.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:52.440
Because I love you.

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.400
But...

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.900
It's a bit sad.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:02.520
Even that fake kiss...

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:05.650
It was only to make you think that...

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.610
I'm sorry I made you tag along with something so stupid.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.890
Yeah, you really did.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.150
Because I love you.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.360
Because he said he loved me.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.950
Shushin sent this?

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:01.610
Chikyou?

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.460
The Essence and Blood Boiling Technique he says?!

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.330
A wind blowing through this valley

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:42.760
Carries a new season along with it.

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:49.280
Amid days that seemed stuck on repeat,

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:55.080
I found a piece of happiness.

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:02.180
Twinkling days that were spent chasing a dream

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:08.670
Disappeared into the past, leaving memories behind.

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:14.800
But my dreams turn this unyielding passion

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:21.890
Into a newfound strength.
